    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6149" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμφοδον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>street,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				327
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				483.80
